  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Arbetsmarknadsinformation Designst&#xf6;d</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Labour Market Intelligence Design support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design phase to determine whether there exist preconditions for a full scale project through Authority Cooperation for contributing to improved systems for Labour Market Information and Intelligence.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Designfas avseende ett fullskaligt projekt med syfte att genom myndighetssamarbete bidra till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade system f&#xf6;r arbetsmarknadsinformation f&#xf6;r analys och prognoser.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective for the Design support is to allow for the Swedish Public Emplyment Service (SPES) to explore the pre-conditions for a bilateral project aiming to enhance the labour market information systems and intelligence in Kenya, for improved identification of job opportunites and employment services to jobseekers - linked to improved and more relevant skills development.

The specific objective is to elaborate a complete project proposal for a contribution aiming to enhance labour market information/intelligence in Kenya, for improved identification of job opportunities and employment services to job seekers, and linked to improved and more relevant skills development, through Authority Cooperation between SPES and the Ministry for Labour and Social Protection in Kenya, and in collaboration with other relevant stakeholders. The project proposal will be submitted to Sida/Embassy of Sweden in Nairobi as a deliverable of the design phase.</narrative>
  </description>
